  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize matching the ends for Bergenndstyle points. The dice bonuses are great, but the points for double-matching (2 or 3 points) are the foundation of a win.\n\nScorpion Sabotage: If you can track which player is short on tiles, try to lead a number that forces them to play a Scorpion tile, hitting them with penalty points just as they think they are about to domino.\n\nFreezing the Oasis: If you have a strong lead, try to play tiles that force opponents to draw heavily from the Oasis. Once it's empty, you can 'block' the game if you have the lowest remaining pips.",
    Player: "Prioritize matching the ends for Bergenndstyle points. The dice bonuses are great, but the points for double-matching (2 or 3 points) are the foundation of a win.\n\nScorpion Sabotage: If you can track which player is short on tiles, try to lead a number that forces them to play a Scorpion tile, hitting them with penalty points just as they think they are about to domino.\n\nFreezing the Oasis: If you have a strong lead, try to play tiles that force opponents to draw heavily from the Oasis. Once it's empty, you can 'block' the game if you have the lowest remaining pips.",
